                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Studying the adaptation process after moving to other house. Influence of moving on parents and children / adaptation / belonging to a group / family life ( atmosphere, authority, mutual interest and support ) / relations with children / neighbourhood / leisure time / hobbies / housekeeping / job / school attitude / children, family life / relations with siblings and parents, friends / leisure time / school / teacher and pupils, children's new teachers / the child's behaviour at school. Background variables: basic characteristics/ housing situation/ household characteristics/ social class/ readership, mass media, and 'cultural' exposure/ organizational membership</p>"
